  Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b8554db9d3c60eb4bb2a9f83115c0491, type: 3}
  Name: Prism
  Description:
  - That's a machine gun disguised as a prism! The first colour that you get is violet
  - Next colour joining the game will be indigo and the damage is increased by 3
  - Next colour joining the game will be blue and the damage is increased by 4
  - Next colour joining the game will be green and the damage is increased by 5.
    The duration is increased by 0.5 seconds
  - Next colour joining the game will be yellow and the damage is increased by 6
  - Next colour joining the game will be orange and the damage is increased by 7.
    The duration is increased by 0.5 seconds
  - Next colour joining the game will be red and the damage is increased by 8
